<title>SWEDEN: Ericsson says in alliance with Compaq.</title>
<headline>Ericsson says in alliance with Compaq.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish telecoms group Ericsson announced on Friday an alliance with computer group Compaq to develop integrated portable GSM/PC systems.  </p>
<p>The first product resulting from the alliance is expected to be available from the end of 1997, Ericsson said in a statement.</p>
<p>Ericsson and Compaq will develop a system to enable mobile users to seamlessly connect to the Internet or corporate Intranet, send faxes and electronic mail and exchange documents.</p>
<p>The two companies already work together in marketing Ericsson GSM mobile phones and Compaq notebook PCs in Europe.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
